  "description": "G4.Cache is a dedicated .NET library crafted exclusively for the G4™ Engine, offering robust cache management tailored to the engine's dynamic plugin architecture. The library introduces the CacheManager class, a versatile tool designed to synchronize, update, and delete cache entries efficiently within the context of the G4™ Engine. Enjoy seamless integration with the G4™ Engine's extensibility, ensuring optimal performance and responsiveness.",
